{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Argent Blade adds its flat bonus after the 215% weapon damage",
  "contract": "Argent Blade 807268 reads 'dealing 215% Weapon Damage plus AP*0.4725+SP*1.35+421': the flat value 421 + 0.4725 AP is added after the weapon percent. A level 60 Templar with a Walking Stick and 250-400 attack power, no spell power, hits a level 60 target for about 2.15 x (normalized weapon damage 10.5 + AP/14*3.3) + 421 + 0.4725 AP, times the target's mitigation (measured at 0.71 on this target for the holy Scourgebane hit, 262 on average), which gives 420-700 against 1019 when the flat part was multiplied by 2.15.",
